===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*só}} From {{inh|en|enm|there}}, {{m|enm|ther}}, {{m|enm|thare}}, {{m|enm|thar}}, {{m|enm|thore}}, from {{inh|en|ang|þēr}}, {{m|ang|þǣr}}, {{m|ang|þār||there; at that place}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*þār}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*þar||at that place; there}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*tó-r||there}}, from demonstrative pronominal base {{m|ine-pro|*to-||the, that}} + adverbial suffix {{m|ine-pro|*-r̥}}.

Cognate with {{cog|sco|thar}}, {{m|sco|thair||there}}, {{cog|frr|dear}}, {{m|frr|deer}}, {{m|frr|där||there}}, {{cog|stq|deer||there}}, {{cog|fy|dêr||there}}, {{cog|nl|daar||there}}, {{cog|nds|dar||there}}, {{cog|de|da}}, {{m|de|dar-||there}}, {{cog|da|der||there}}, {{cog|no|der||there}}, {{cog|sv|där||there}}, {{cog|is|þar||in that place, there}}.

